        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 706/RT, Simple Door Lever with Rectangular Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple in design with an easy installation, the 706 door lever, made by Omnia, will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. The Simple Solid Brass Leverset with Rectangular Rose is available in dummy and passage functions. It is easy to install and features surface mounting. The Simple Door Lever with Rectangular Rose is available in a wide array of traditional finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: <a href=\"/products/simple-solid-brass-leverset-with-round-rose-omnia-706-00\"><b>Omnia 706 Traditional Leverset With Round Rose</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Simple Door Lever Latchset with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Surface Mounted</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 706/RT Simple Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-brass-pinapple.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"600\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
