                "title": "Simple Solid Brass Leverset with Rectangular Rose",
                "description": "Simple in design with an easy installation, the 706 door lever, made by Omnia, will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. The Simple Solid Brass Leverset with Rectangular Rose is available in dummy and passage functions. It is easy to install and features surface mounting. The Simple Door Lever with Rectangular Rose is available in a wide array of traditional finishes.\r\n",
